  "description": "I accidentally got possessed while working overtime! And it was in a game that was scheduled to be scrapped after being deemed harmful by the review committee. Now, in order to return home, I had to raise my ‘ability’ and become a hero. But the method to raise that ability was… \n\n*“Ability can be obtained every time you seduce a man with a ‘strategy card’. To be exact, it’s based on semen absorption.”*\n\nShe had discovered a new aptitude. One that she couldn’t find anywhere, at school or work. Its name was semen absorption.\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)",
